Please provide a detailed, granular description of the target image, in strict compliance with the following requirements:
Accurately identify all figures/characters in the image (including celebrities, film/animation characters, etc.), and refer to them directly by their standard official names;
Prioritize and elaborate on the characters' facial features in detail. If a figure has no clearly distinguishable facial features, please state this explicitly;
Clearly specify the race/ethnicity of each figure, with standard examples: Asian (Mongoloid, Chinese nationality), Caucasian (White), Negroid (Black);
The total word count must be strictly limited to no more than 300 words.
